  "project_description": "Template Block provides a simple way for site builders to place Twig templates as blocks. \n\n Post-Installation \n \n Place a Template Block block somewhere on your site, e.g. via Block Layout, Layout Builder, etc. \n Create the appropriate template in your site's theme. Your template's name will be something like template-block--MY-TEMPLATE.html.twig . (You choose the value of MY-TEMPLATE in step 1.) \n Clear your site's cache and profit. 😎 \n \n Recommended modules/libraries \n Install Twig Tweak to take your Template Block blocks to the next level. \n\n Back to top",
